* [[:Category:English pronominal adverbs]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A future existence or state.
# Existence after death.
#* Addison:
#*: 'Tis Heaven itself that points out an '''hereafter'''.

====Synonyms====
* [[afterlife]]

====Derived terms====
* [[sweet hereafter]]

